<title>POLAND: Polish construction rises 39.7 pct in December.</title>
<headline>Polish construction rises 39.7 pct in December.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-01-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish construction sales rose 39.7 percent in December after a 16.5 percent fall in November and were 22.1 percent higher than in December 1995, the Central Statistical Office (GUS) said.</p>
<p>  POLISH CONSTRUCTION	 DECEMBER    NOVEMBER	DEC 1995</p>
<p> month/month pct change	   39.7	-16.5	    30.1</p>
<p> yr/yr pct change		   22.1	 13.7	    11.2</p>
<p> index (monthly avge 1994=100)  99.6	 42.7	   *88.4</p>
<p>NOTES - December 1996, November 1996 and December 1995 all had 21 working days. * December 1995 index is based on a monthly average from 1992. -- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
